==Battleground==
*10 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 4 seconds<sup>120f</sup>, delay 2~16 seconds<sup>60f~480f</sup>.
*15 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 6 seconds<sup>180f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Sunny Celeboodle]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 4~12 seconds<sup>120f~360f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 4~30 seconds<sup>120f~900f</sup>.
**10 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 4~6 seconds<sup>120f~180f</sup>.
**10 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn, delay 4~6 seconds<sup>120f~180f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn, delay 26.67~43.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
As long as the player owns [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]], this stage shouldn't be much of an issue as Bahamut Cat can take out Sunny Celeboodle in under 2 hits. The peons also provide plenty of cash, allowing you to spam [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cats]] to fend off the Otta-smack-us.

==Trivia==
*Like all [[Never Summer! (Monthly Event)|Never Summer!]] stages, Boy Meats Girl is a reference to a song, in this case "[https://youtu.be/EgGnreyPmaQ BOY MEETS GIRL]" by [[wikipedia:TRF (group)|TRF]].
**It is the only Never Summer! stage whose reference wasn't lost in translation, although the Japanese name being in all caps does make it more obvious.

